From 6af5626f6f6c34b4691674902ea84b25add1600b Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Senior Matthew <SeniorMatt@users.noreply.github.com>
Date: Sun, 22 Nov 2026 01:27:59 +0500
Subject: [PATCH 22/24] kcm_soundtheme: theme list built after the first frame,
 link to per-event sounds
MIME-Version: 1.0
Content-Type: text/plain; charset=UTF-8
Content-Transfer-Encoding: 8bit

Page type: Gallery (docs/page-design.md section 5). Config keys (Sounds/Enable, Sounds/Theme), canberra preview and theme
install are unchanged.

Moved / renamed:
- "Enable notification sounds" -> "Play notification sounds" (no "Enable" prefix, page-design section 6); old wording kept
  as alias in ia/layout.json. Row kcm_soundtheme/soundsEnabled.
- New page action "Sounds for Events…" opens kcm_notifications via KCMLauncher (per-event sounds are chosen there,
  ia/duplicates.md); hidden when KAuthorized denies the module.
- Removed the opacity 0.75 on the theme description (page-design section 3: no opacity tricks).
- Install from File… stays a page action top right. Relabel table: inventory/relabel/kcm_soundtheme.tsv (outer repo).
  Inventory --strict: 5 rows ok, 0 lost (markers added to the four rows that only had weak anchors).

Speed: load() ran loadThemes() synchronously (QStandardPaths::locateAll, a directory scan and one index.theme parse per
theme, kcm_soundtheme.cpp loadThemes). It now runs from a QTimer::singleShot(0) queued by load(), guarded against
repeated calls, so the page frame is shown first and the grid fills on themesLoaded. After-numbers: pending, manager
will measure.

HIG: HIG-001/005 (current state first), HIG-057 (no Advanced). Not built yet. API not confirmed by a build:
org.kde.config import for KAuthorized (same as kcms/fonts/ui/main.qml).

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
Claude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_01X5N5x9eWzmrq6QYrYLwQnk
---
 kcms/soundtheme/kcm_soundtheme.cpp |  9 ++++++++-
 kcms/soundtheme/kcm_soundtheme.h   |  1 +
 kcms/soundtheme/ui/main.qml        | 16 ++++++++++++++--
 3 files changed, 23 insertions(+), 3 deletions(-)

diff --git a/kcms/soundtheme/kcm_soundtheme.cpp b/kcms/soundtheme/kcm_soundtheme.cpp
index 3504991..c78e9b8 100644
--- a/kcms/soundtheme/kcm_soundtheme.cpp
+++ b/kcms/soundtheme/kcm_soundtheme.cpp
@@ -122,7 +122,14 @@ QString KCMSoundTheme::nameFor(const QString &themeId) const
 void KCMSoundTheme::load()
 {
     KQuickManagedConfigModule::load();
-    loadThemes();
+    // ksr: scanning the sound directories and parsing every index.theme must not delay the first frame
+    if (!m_loadPending) {
+        m_loadPending = true;
+        QTimer::singleShot(0, this, [this]() {
+            m_loadPending = false;
+            loadThemes();
+        });
+    }
 }
 
 void KCMSoundTheme::loadThemes()
diff --git a/kcms/soundtheme/kcm_soundtheme.h b/kcms/soundtheme/kcm_soundtheme.h
index 2122702..f807215 100644
--- a/kcms/soundtheme/kcm_soundtheme.h
+++ b/kcms/soundtheme/kcm_soundtheme.h
@@ -105,4 +105,5 @@ private:
     QString m_playingSound;
 
     QPointer<KIO::FileCopyJob> m_tempCopyJob;
+    bool m_loadPending = false;
 };
